    "abilities": {
      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "IllaoiPassive",
        "name": "Prophet of an Elder God",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Illaoi and the <font color='#669900'>Vessels</font> she creates spawn Tentacles on nearby impassible terrain. Tentacles swing at spirits, <font color='#669900'>Vessels</font>, and victims of Illaoi's Harsh lesson. Tentacles deal physical damage to enemies hit, and will heal Illaoi if they damage a champion.",
        "bodyHtml": "Illaoi draws the presence of her god, spawning a Tentacle on nearby terrain if no other Tentacles are nearby (<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">(18 ~ 7)</span> second cooldown). Tentacles will not attack on their own, but can be made to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> by Illaoi's Abilities.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>. Hitting at least one enemy champion restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">5% missing Health</span> to Illaoi.",
