        "summary": "Increases the damage dealt by Tentacles. When activated, Illaoi smashes down a Tentacle that deals physical damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Passive:</span> <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> damage is increased by <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"></span> (currently <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>).<br /><br /><span>Active:</span> Illaoi swings her idol, causing a Tentacle to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> forward.",
