        "name": "Leap of Faith",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Illaoi smashes her idol into the ground, dealing physical damage to nearby enemies. A Tentacle spawns for each enemy champion hit.",
        "bodyHtml": "Illaoi smashes her idol into the ground, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (50% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to nearby enemies and spawning a Tentacle for each enemy champion hit.<br /><br />For the next 8 seconds, Tentacles are untargetable and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> 50% faster, and <span>Harsh Lesson</span> has a second cooldown.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Spirits from <span>Test Of Spirit</span> also generate a Tentacle if hit by this ability.</span>",
